==German==

===Etymology===
From a {{clipping|de|Osten|t=east|nocap=1}} {{suffix|de||-i}}. The form {{m|de||Ossi}} (instead of {{m|de||*Osti}}) might suggest a humorous reinterpretation of {{der|de|en|Aussie||Australian person}}, although this English word has not been widely known in Germany. {{rfe|de}}

